      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seems more likely to happen with worlds that I have favorited. It'll show tens or hundreds of players, but when clicking on it, there are no public instances and it shows 0 players playing. If you then go to the website, it'll show accurate data and you can join through the website, but this is annoying while in VR.\n\nLots of people reporting this issue on reddit, https://old.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/14ltwo0/is_this_a_bug_with_vrchat_or_is_it_my_connection/",
